          <p class="eyebrow">Section 05</p>
          <h2>Install</h2>

          <h3 class="clause clause--gap"><span class="cnum">5.1</span> Quick start</h3>
          <p class="body">Sagan v0 is files plus protocol — any capable coding
            agent session can act as the PM by reading
            <span class="mono">sagan.yaml</span> and the role specs.</p>
          <ol class="steps">
            <li><strong>Install the overlay</strong>
              <span>With the <span class="mono">wire-sagan</span> installer (a
              Claude Code skill) — it probes your project&rsquo;s entry point and
              captures your real gate commands — or copy
              <span class="mono">.sagan/</span> from the repo and empty the
              ledger and tickets.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Set your gates</strong>
              <span>Put your project&rsquo;s real test / typecheck / build commands
              in <span class="mono">.sagan/sagan.yaml</span>.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Write the AC</strong>
              <span>Copy <span class="mono">tickets/T-000-example.md</span> and
              write the acceptance criteria — before any dispatch.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Run the loop</strong>
              <span>Tell your agent session to run the ticket through the loop;
              promote gates keep you in the decision seat.</span></li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <figure class="c-6-10 div-l">
          <div class="fig-head">
            <span class="t">The overlay</span>
            <span class="f">tree</span>
          </div>
          <div class="panel">
<pre class="ledger" is:raw>.sagan/
  sagan.yaml   <b>#</b> wiring: bindings, critique
               <b>#</b>   policy, round caps, gates,
               <b>#</b>   your real gate commands
  roles/       <b>#</b> provider-neutral role specs
  tickets/     <b>#</b> work contracts: AC +
               <b>#</b>   per-role blocks + decisions
  memory/      <b>#</b> per-task retros, pruned
               <b>#</b>   after synthesis
  MEMORY.md    <b>#</b> rolling project learnings
  ledger/      <b>#</b> events.jsonl + evidence</pre>
          </div>
          <figcaption class="caption">Fig. 05 — one directory to add · delete it to un-wire</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="c-10-13 div-l">
          <h3 class="clause"><span class="cnum">5.2</span> Status — v0, honest</h3>
          <ul class="status">
            <li><strong>Validated</strong>
              <span>The contract-shaped loop — AC-first, isolated critique, evidence-bound verification, promote gates — proven by the T-001 run.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Not built yet</strong>
              <span>Runtime enforcement. Round caps and gates are interpreted by the PM model, not enforced by code — treated as the first real infrastructure work.</span></li>
            <li><strong>Roadmap</strong>
              <span>Enforced caps, isolation, and containment floors as code; provider-heterogeneous bindings; event store and team surface.</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>

